 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a5ecd9a7a006.png\">\n<p>2026年度 社會組 職棋甄選-複賽，本日(7/21)進行第四天的賽事</p>\n<p>第七輪賽後，蔡品倩晉升職業棋士！(依據社會組甄選辦法，女子名列複賽前五名即可晉升新科職棋)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260721_5%20-%20%E8%A4%87%E8%A3%BD.jpg\"></p>\n<p>                                                              (新科職棋 蔡品倩)</p>\n<hr>\n<p>第八輪賽後</p>\n<p>A組</p>\n<p>陳義豐 取得7勝1負，即將取得決賽門票</p>\n<p>黃麒祐、黃昀宥、謝知勵，取得5勝3負，繼續保持在前段班</p>\n<p>B組</p>\n<p>蔡品倩 取得8勝0負，當之無愧提前四輪晉升新科職棋</p>\n<p>林秉寬 取得7勝1負，有望拿下決賽門票</p>\n<p>陳雲亮 取得6勝2負，努力緊追在後</p>\n<p>詳細戰績如下：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11KOXhKt2IxKQolt_FE8akbXqx3CJ5zEDHLPSrtpmRSs/edit?gid=1758320847#gid=1758320847\">社會組 職棋甄選-複賽A組 成績表</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1k5nZgUwjHhXCtae1kgIQzbJAoTGFiH6o_X-b6mjVCO0/edit?gid=2060681847#gid=2060681847\">社會組 職棋甄選-複賽B組 成績表</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%20%E8%A4%87%E8%B3%BDA%E7%B5%84%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8_page-0001%20%284%29.jpg\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%20%E8%A4%87%E8%B3%BDB%E7%B5%84%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8_page-0001%20%284%29.jpg\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260721_1.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260721_4.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260721_3.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260721_2.jpg\"></p>"
